Third-party sources vendored for the "pysdf_cuda" radius-search backend
======================================================================

This directory contains a minimal, OptiX-free subset of third-party CUDA
sources required to build the software-QBVH point-range-query used by the
``PHYSICSNEMO_RADIUS_SEARCH_MORTON=pysdf_cuda`` backend. Only the headers and
translation units in the dependency closure of the radius query were copied;
the SDF / OptiX portions of the upstream projects were intentionally excluded.

Each file retains its original copyright/license header. All vendored files are
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

