Adapted source (not vendored verbatim)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The device kernels in ``../radius_search_ext.cu`` are adapted from pysdf
``src/prq.cu`` (NVIDIA "pysdf", https://gitlab-master.nvidia.com/mrietmann/pysdf,
commit 34aa4e06385f4c58d9cf41c9e21576f5923bda72, Apache-2.0). They were modified
to operate directly on PyTorch device tensors and to select the ``max_points``
nearest neighbors per query in a single traversal pass.
